m the Internet Archive/unverified|PD US expired|Scans from the Internet Archive|Books uploaded by F\u00e6|Books without Wikidata item|Images from the Getty Research Institute|PD-US missing SDC copyright status|French-language books","source":"commons-categories","hidden":""},"Assessments":{"value":"","source":"commons-categories","hidden":""},"Artist":{"value":"<div class=\"fn value\">\n<dl><dd>Huart, Louis, 1813-1865</dd>\n<dd>Trimolet, Louis Joseph, 1812-1843</dd>\n<dd>Vernier, Charles, 1831-1887</dd></dl></div>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"ImageDescription":{"value":"<div class=\"description\">\n<dl><dd>Some of the wood engravings have engravers' signatures, including: C. Denisard, N. Deschamps, E. Forest, Halle v Hiback, Lacoste, Louis Lesestre, Sotaim</dd>\n<dd>Publisher's binding in light blue paper over pasteboard. Page edges gilt. The \"douze gravures\" mentioned in the title apparently include that on the front cover by V. Beauc\u00e9, in addition to 11 in the text (with guard tissues)</dd></dl>\n<br>Subjects:</div>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Credit":{"value":"<dl><dd><a href=\"//archive.org/details/lecomicalmanackk00huar\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"iarchive:lecomicalmanackk00huar\"><bdi class=\"description en\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">Internet Archive identifier</bdi>: lecomicalmanackk00huar</a></dd>\n<dd><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://archive.org/download/lecomicalmanackk00huar/lecomicalmanackk00huar.pdf\">https://archive.org/download/lecomicalmanackk00huar/lecomicalmanackk00huar.pdf</a></dd></dl>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"Public domain","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"UsageTerms":{"value":"Public domain","source":"commons-desc-page"},"AttributionRequired":{"value":"false","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"Copyrighted":{"value":"False","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"Restrictions":{"value":"","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"License":{"value":"pd","source":"commons-templates","hidden":""}},"mime":"application/pdf"}]},"74940400":{"pageid":74940400,"ns":6,"title":"File:Manifestation des Gilets jaunes \u00e0 Paris samedi 8 d\u00e9cembre.webm","index":2,"imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"size":145321106,"width":1280,"height":720,"duration":348.609,"thumburl":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1e/Manifestation_des_Gilets_jaunes_%C3%A0_Paris_samedi_8_d%C3%A9cembre.webm/1280px--Manifestation_des_Gilets_jaunes_%C3%A0_Paris_samedi_8_d%C3%A9cembre.webm.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo","thumbwidth":1280,"thumbheight":720,"thumbattribs":[],"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1e/Manifestation_des_Gilets_jaunes_%C3%A0_Paris_samedi_8_d%C3%A9cembre.webm?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Manifestation_des_Gilets_jaunes_%C3%A0_Paris_samedi_8_d%C3%A9cembre.webm","descriptionshorturl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=74940400","extmetadata":{"DateTime":{"value":"2018-12-09 07:36:46","source":"mediawiki-metadata","hidden":""},"ObjectName":{"value":"Manifestation des Gilets jaunes \u00e0 Paris samedi 8 d\u00e9cembre","source":"mediawiki-metadata"},"CommonsMetadataExtension":{"value":1.2,"source":"extension","hidden":""},"Categories":{"value":"Media from YouTube|Uploaded with video2commons|Videos of 2018 from France|License reviewed by YouTubeReviewBot|Videos taken on 2018-12-08|Mouvement des gilets jaunes, Paris, 08 Dec 2018","source":"commons-categories","hidden":""},"Assessments":{"value":"","source":"commons-categories","hidden":""},"ImageDescription":{"value":"Manifestation des Gilets jaunes \u00e0 Paris  samedi 8 d\u00e9cembre en direct Nos expositions et \u00e9v\u00e9nements n'auront plus de secret pour vous\u00a0!\n<p>L\u2019alerte maximale est d\u00e9cr\u00e9t\u00e9e en France pour ce nouveau samedi de manifestations des \u00ab\u00a0gilets jaunes\u00a0\u00bb. La crise d\u00e9chire le pays et sid\u00e8re le monde.\n</p><p>89.000 membres des forces de l\u2019ordre dans toute la France, dont 8.000 \u00e0 Paris, sont mobilis\u00e9s afin de tenter d\u2019\u00e9viter les m\u00eames sc\u00e8nes d\u2019\u00e9meutes que le samedi 1er d\u00e9cembre. \u00c0 Paris, pour la premi\u00e8re fois depuis des d\u00e9cennies, l\u2019\u00c9tat engagera des \u00ab\u00a0VBRG\u00a0\u00bb, ces v\u00e9hicules blind\u00e9s \u00e0 roue de la gendarmerie. Le GIGN et ses antennes r\u00e9gionales ont \u00e9t\u00e9 mis en alerte renforc\u00e9e.\n</p><p>L\u2019ex\u00e9cutif craint une alliance entre ultradroite, ultragauche, \u00ab\u00a0gilets jaunes\u00a0\u00bb les plus remont\u00e9s et jeunes de banlieue, dont certains se sont livr\u00e9s \u00e0 des pillages samedi dernier dans la capitale.\n</p><p>VERS UN SAMEDI NOIR\u00a0? - Alors que l'Elys\u00e9e dit craindre des manifestations \"d'une grande violence\" ce samedi lors de \"l'acte 4\" des Gilets jaunes, 89.000 membres des forces de l'ordre sont mobilis\u00e9s, dont 8000 dans les rues de la capitale. Les derni\u00e8res infos en direct.\nCe samedi 8 d\u00e9cembre 2018 marque \u00ab\u00a0l\u2019acte 4\u00a0\u00bb de la mobilisation des Gilets jaunes. Apr\u00e8s les incidents du week-end dernier, les forces de l\u2019ordre tentent de canaliser une nouvelle flamb\u00e9e de violence.\n</p><p>L\u2019essentiel\u00a0:\n</p><p>Des manifestations de Gilets jaunes sont organis\u00e9es dans toute la France pour cet \u00ab\u00a0acte 4\u00a0\u00bb du mouvement. Des autoroutes comme l\u2019A6 et des ronds-points sont bloqu\u00e9s, des incidents sont enregistr\u00e9s pr\u00e8s de Caen.<br>\nUn dispositif \u00ab\u00a0exceptionnel\u00a0\u00bb des forces de l\u2019ordre est d\u00e9ploy\u00e9 dans tout le pays. 89 000 membres des forces de l\u2019ordre sont mobilis\u00e9s, dont 8 000 dans la capitale.<br>\nLa mobilisation des Gilets jaunes \u00e0 Paris a donn\u00e9 lieu \u00e0 481 interpellations et 211 placements en garde \u00e0 vue, a annonc\u00e9 le Premier ministre Edouard Philippe dans la matin\u00e9e.\n</p><p>11h30. Tensions avenue Friedland. Un de nos reporters pr\u00e9sent avenue Friedland indique que des dizaines de Gilets jaunes qui veulent aller manifester sur les Champs-Elys\u00e9es sont bloqu\u00e9s par les forces de l'ordre, ce qui cr\u00e9e des tensions. \u00ab\u00a0Tous ensemble tous ensemble\u00a0\u00bb, scandent les refoul\u00e9s aux gendarmes mobiles.\n</p>\n11h15. Le p\u00e9riph\u00e9rique n\u2019est plus bloqu\u00e9. L\u2019action rapide des CRS permet de repousser les manifestants et de d\u00e9loquer le p\u00e9riph\u00e9rique au niveau de la porte Maillot selon notre journaliste.","source":"commons-desc-page"},"DateTimeOriginal":{"value":"2018-12-08","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Credit":{"value":"<bdi lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><a href=\"//commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Commons:YouTube_files\" title=\"Commons:YouTube files\">YouTube</a>: <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4GeLQnWsYmI\"><bdi lang=\"\">Manifestation des Gilets jaunes \u00e0 Paris  samedi 8 d\u00e9cembre en direct</bdi></a> \u2013 View/save archived versions on <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/*/https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4GeLQnWsYmI\">archive.org</a></bdi>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Artist":{"value":"<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC-Sb33n6vQJyWYyn8nOwLpA\">Tanja</a>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"CC BY 3.0","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"UsageTerms":{"value":"Creative Commons Attribution 3.0","source":"commons-desc-page"},"AttributionRequired":{"value":"true","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"Attribution":{"value":"Tanja","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"LicenseUrl":{"value":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Copyrighted":{"value":"True","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"Restrictions":{"value":"","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"License":{"value":"cc-by-3.0","source":"commons-templates","hidden":""}},"mime":"video/webm"}]}}}}